# The autopoet eval harness — run it, read it, extend it

The eval system that proves the autopoet works (docs/eval-genesis-plan.md is the
living plan; eval/history.log is the record). This page is the operator's map —
sessions and CI inherit it instead of re-discovering commit archaeology.

**When to use:** running or extending autopoet evals, reading a scorecard,
deciding whether a number can be trusted.

## The commands
- `mix eval` — the whole scorecard: genesis, personas, task suites, replay
  (prequential vs baselines + CIs), integrity sweeps, heartbeat, containment,
  detector bench, genome, integrations, corpus countdowns, efficiency, armlift,
  select tournament, soak. Deterministic, hermetic, no network.
- `mix eval.iso` — same suite in a throwaway CLEAN ROOM (own home + port). Any
  number run IN PARALLEL with zero shared state. Use for concurrent runs.
- `AUTOPOET_LIVE=1 mix eval.live` — the LIVE tier (real LLM, real spend).
  Double-locked: the :live tag is excluded everywhere else AND the env var is
  required. `AUTOPOET_LIVE_PERSONAS=all` widens beyond the shop-seller canary.
  Every task writes a full transcript to eval/live-runs/<stamp>/.
- `AUTOPOET_SOAK_SECONDS=3600 mix eval` — scales the soak leg (default 15s).

## Reading the record
- `eval/history.log` — one line per number per run: timestamp · git sha ·
  metric name · k=v pairs. Greppable, diffable across commits. Never JSON.
- Gates are PRE-REGISTERED: thresholds committed before outcomes; changing a
  gate is itself a recorded act. Corpus gates (C1/C2/C4) self-report a
  COUNTDOWN until their data threshold is met — a pending gate skips loudly,
  it never fabricates a pass.
- Live-tier posture is OBSERVATIONAL first: pass-rates are reported and
  transcripts human-reviewed before any gate lands on them.

## House discipline (the rules that keep numbers honest)
- Validate the instrument first: the eval runs the PRODUCTION arithmetic
  (pure Model modules shared verbatim), never a reimplementation.
- One clean environment per trial; never iterate against the holdout traces
  (odd-day traces are HOLDOUT, touched once per pre-registered decision).
- Grade OUTCOMES, never reference-solution internals (no name-pinning).
- Read sampled transcripts every cycle; failures classify by taxonomy
  (wrong_artifact / gate_refused / invalid_format / crashed) so regressions
  localize.
